Guance.Windows.Native is distributed by the guance-windows-native port and
provides the CMake package GuanceWindowsNative:

    find_package(GuanceWindowsNative CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE Guance::WindowsNative)

Install the optional Electron native bridge with:

    vcpkg install "guance-windows-native[electron-bridge]:x64-windows"

The bridge executable and its runtime dependencies are installed under:

    tools/guance-windows-native

The initial port supports the dynamic x64-windows triplet. Session Replay is
experimental, opt-in, and disabled by default at runtime. The port has no
default SQLite dependency.
